Every processor declares which method it handles, and the service builds a lookup once.
```csharp
public interface IPaymentProcessor {
    PaymentMethod Method { get; }
    Task<PaymentResult> PayAsync(PaymentRequest req, CancellationToken ct);
}
public class PaymentService(IEnumerable<IPaymentProcessor> processors) {
    private readonly Dictionary<PaymentMethod, IPaymentProcessor> _map = processors.ToDictionary(p => p.Method);
    public Task<PaymentResult> PayAsync(PaymentRequest r, CancellationToken ct) =>
        _map.TryGetValue(r.Method, out var p) ? p.PayAsync(r, ct)
            : throw new NotSupportedException($"Unsupported method {r.Method}");
}
```

